WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.360
Do you know what "Srećni ljudi"

2
00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:03.940
and "Ljubav, navika, panika" have in common?

3
00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:07.000
One of the best-known Belgrade addresses —

4
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.760
undoubtedly Topolska 18 in Vračar,

5
00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:12.760
which has a special status in Serbian culture.

6
00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:15.700
This place is remembered above all

7
00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:18.460
from the famous hit of the series "Srećni ljudi,"

8
00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:21.740
but few know that at this very address

9
00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:25.140
the comic adventures of the Miličević family unfolded

10
00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:27.780
from the cult series "Ljubav, navika, panika."

11
00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:31.080
In this apartment the divorced parents Vera and Mića

12
00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:33.440
continued to live under one roof

13
00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:35.620
with their daughters Maja and Jana,

14
00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:38.700
creating daily chaos full of quarrels,

15
00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:39.980
rigged situations

16
00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:42.820
and famous philosophical conversations over coffee.

17
00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:46.220
While Maja was constantly looking for new boyfriends,

18
00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:48.380
and the younger Jana found ways

19
00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:50.800
to profit from the family madness.

20
00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:53.240
This house in Vračar became home

21
00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:56.660
to some of the wittiest scenes on Serbian television,

22
00:00:56.660 --> 00:01:00.240
thus bringing together two extremely popular projects

23
00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:01.980
at the same address.